WEBVTT

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.860
Thanks for calling Ace Dentist. I'm Liv. How can

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:10.260
I help?

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.140
Hi, Liv. I need to book an appointment for my

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.100
son. He's got a toothache he's been complaining

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:16.360
about.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.460
And yeah, he just needs an appointment ASAP.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.700
Is your son experiencing any swelling, uncontrolled

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.460
bleeding, trauma or trouble breathing or swallowing?

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.160
No, no, none of that. Just he's complaining about

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.160
his toothache is causing him a headache and things

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:35.660
of that nature.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:36.840
I just want to get him checked out, make sure

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:37.620
it's nothing too serious.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:43.780
Is this your son's first visit with us or has

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.080
he been to the practice before?

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.020
It will be his first time.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.400
Thanks. May I have your son's full name and the

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.900
best phone number to reach you on?

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.180
His name is Malachi, Malachi Adams.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:07.500
Best phone number to reach you on?

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:09.580
[Contact detail privacy beep]

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:17.770
Do you have a preference for a day or time for

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:20.610
the appointment? Morning, afternoon or any time?

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.030
I mean, it's pretty bad. He's been complaining.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.710
Is there any slots for today?

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:28.210
Back in the evening, maybe.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:37.120
There are no regular appointment slots left today,

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:39.700
but I do have some emergency slots tonight with

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:41.220
an emergency call out surcharge.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.200
I can offer 9 .30, 10 in the evening or 10 .30.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.560
Does any of those times work for you?

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.520
Yeah, we can do 9 .30. 9 .30 works.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:55.700
Thanks. Is your email address available or would

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.200
you prefer not to provide it?

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:59.360
I prefer not to provide it. I don't think it's

00:01:59.360 --> 00:01:59.660
necessary.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:09.240
Confirm. I have booked a new urgent dental assessment

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.620
appointment for Malachi.

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:13.500
Malachi Adams on Tuesday, the 6th of October at

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.560
9 .30 in the evening with the emergency call out

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.040
surcharge.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:20.800
[Contact detail privacy beep]

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:25.310
Is that all correct?

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.650
Yep, that's all right. Thank you.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:32.490
The appointment is all set for Tuesday, the 6th

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.330
of October at 9 .30 in the evening.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:36.570
The team has everything they need.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:40.090
Thanks for calling Ace Dentists and I hope Malachi

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:40.970
feels better soon.
